#: buildVars.py:20
msgid "Contacts Manager for NVDA"
msgstr "Gerînendeyê Têkiliyan ji bo NVDA"

#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
#: buildVars.py:23
msgid ""
"Simple contacts manager for saving phone numbers, emails, and other contact "
"details for personal or professional use.\n"
"\n"
"Shortcut Windows+Alt+L."
msgstr ""
"Gerînendeyekî têkiliyên hêsan ji bo tomarkirina hejmarên telefonê, e-nameyan "
"û agahdariyên din ên têkiliyê ji bo karanîna şexsî an pîşeyî.\n"
"\n"
"Kurterêya Windows+Alt+L."

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
#: buildVars.py:30
msgid ""
"The new translation system via Crowdin has been integrated and the "
"localization files have been updated."
msgstr ""
"Pergala wergera nû ya bi rêya Crowdin hate entegre kirin û pelên herêmî "
"hatin nûvekirin."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Updates the latest tested version of NVDA to 2026.1.0.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "\t\t\t\t   Introduces multiple enhancements to contact handling:\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "- Directly open saved contacts in WhatsApp from the contact list.\n"
#~ "- Perform a search when Enter is pressed in the search field.\n"
#~ "- Intercept Ctrl+V on contact phone fields to paste only digits.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Details:\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "- Direct WhatsApp Opening (Contact List): Pressing Enter on a contact in "
#~ "the list now opens that contact directly in WhatsApp.\n"
#~ "- Search Execution (Search Field): Pressing Enter in the search field now "
#~ "triggers the search action.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Clean Pasted Phone Input:\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "- Binds EVTCHARHOOK for cell and landline inputs.\n"
#~ "- Adds `onPasteAndClean` to: Read the clipboard.\n"
#~ "Strip non-digit characters using a regex.\n"
#~ "- Set the cleaned value into the focused field (skipping default paste).\n"
#~ "- Allows non-paste keys to be processed normally via `event.Skip()`.\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Guhertoya herî dawî ya ceribandî ya NVDA bo 2026.1.0 nûve dike.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "\t\t\t\t   Gelek başkirinan ji bo birêvebirina têkiliyan tîne:\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "- Têkiliyên tomarkirî yên di WhatsAppê de rasterast ji navnîşa têkiliyan "
#~ "vekin.\n"
#~ "- Dema ku Enter di qada lêgerînê de tê pêlkirin lêgerînek pêk bînin.\n"
#~ "- Ji bo ku tenê hejmaran bixin, Ctrl+V li ser qadên telefona têkiliyê "
#~ "bigirin.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Hûrgulî:\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "- Vekirina Rasterast a WhatsAppê (Lîsteya Têkiliyan): Pêlkirina Enterê li "
#~ "ser têkiliyek di navnîşê de naha wê têkiliyê rasterast di WhatsAppê de "
#~ "vedike.\n"
#~ "- Pêkanîna Lêgerînê (Qada Lêgerînê): Pêlkirina Enterê di qada lêgerînê de "
#~ "naha çalakiya lêgerînê dide destpêkirin.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "Têketina Telefonê ya Paqijkirî ya Çêkirî:\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "- EVTCHARHOOK ji bo têketinên mobîl û xeta sabît girêdide.\n"
#~ "- `onPasteAndClean` zêde dike bo: Bixwîne clipboardê.\n"
#~ "Karakterên ne-reqemî bi karanîna regex-ê jê bike.\n"
#~ "- Nirxa paqijkirî têxe nav qada fokuskirî (çêkirina pêveka xwerû derbas "
#~ "dike).\n"
#~ "- Destûr dide ku mifteyên ne-çêkirî bi rêya `event.Skip()` bi awayekî "
#~ "normal werin pêvajo kirin.\n"
